WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.975
RCMP Complicity in MAID.

00:00:02.925 --> 00:00:11.187
When Canada passed Bill C-14 in 2016 and Bill C-7 in 2021, the RCMP stood silent.

00:00:11.187 --> 00:00:20.800
Two Commissioners — Paulson and Lucki — possessed armed jurisdiction to intervene against what behaves structurally as a modern rebirth of Aktion T4.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.825
They chose not to.

00:00:22.825 --> 00:00:30.725
The question is: why didn't Canada's federal police arrest the politicians executing a state-sponsored termination program?
